# ============================================================
# SlugTube Channels — Example Configuration
# ============================================================
# Format: URL|FolderName
# The folder name is locked — yt-dlp will always use it,
# regardless of what YouTube calls the channel.
#
# Examples:
# https://www.youtube.com/@MrBeast|MrBeast
# https://www.youtube.com/@veritasium|Veritasium
# https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLrAXtmErZgOeiKm4sgNOknGvNjby9efdf|Numberphile Playlist
#
# Notes:
# - One entry per line
# - Lines starting with # are comments
# - Blank lines are ignored
# - Playlist URLs are supported (use playlist?list= format)
# - Folder names should be filesystem-safe (avoid special characters)
# ============================================================
